ratings.long_description:
Professional and excellent use of presentation tools (texts, tables, images, animation, video etc);
High-quality and professional slide design and consistent uses of appropriate font and colours on all slides;
High-level readability and clarity with well-designed structure and smooth logic flow to guide audience
Professional balance between the content details and the highlights with appropriate titles and consistent and professional styles.

Always professional and good use of presentation tools (texts, tables, images, animation, video etc);
Slide design is always or almost always professional; choice of font and colours on all slides is usually or always appropriate;
The readability and clarity of slides are always or almost always appropriate and the structure and logic flow are mostly good to guide audience
Good and proper balance between the content details and the highlights with appropriate titles and consistent and professional styles
There may be some minor lapses.

Most of presentation tools have been well used (texts, tables, images, animation, video etc);
Slide design is not always professional; choice of font and colours on all slides is not always appropriate;
The readability and clarity of slides are not always appropriate and some design structure and logic flow are good to guide audience
Balance between the content details and the highlights can be good but may lack appropriate titles and slide style is not consistent and professional
Some slides may have issues with excessive text, overcrowded / with too many or too small text
There are some significant lapses.

Some of presentation tools have been used (texts, tables, images, animation, video etc);
Lack of consistent and professional slide design, choice of fonts and colours on slides are used appropriately at least some of the time;
Some slides are easily readable but most of the slides lack of readability and clarity to follow;
Content details appear random without necessary highlights and may lack appropriate titles and slide style is not consistent and professional
Slides may have issues with excessive text, overcrowded / with too many or too small text, and very plain dull layout;
There are more serious lapses.

The slides suffer from very poor readability due to persistent misuse of fonts, colours, and whitespace;
Slides have issues with excessive text, overcrowded / with too many or too small text, and very plain dull layout;
Some slides are irrelevant and incomprehensible.
